{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471670/extras/151a0851e290b900da543f7f9d8feea7.webp?t=1749337493\" width=474 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471670/extras/a43387af2679580f04ef3ba82b54edb5.poster.avif?t=1749337493\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471670/extras/a43387af2679580f04ef3ba82b54edb5.webm?t=1749337493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471670/extras/a43387af2679580f04ef3ba82b54edb5.mp4?t=1749337493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Flayed Man is a short, chilling experience ~30 minutes long, perfect for playing before bed, especially if you\u2019re in the mood for a nightmare.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the Flayed Man. Awaking in a decayed, otherworldly house where your every waking moment is agony, you must uncover the sins of the past, pass judgement, and decide your fate in this unsettling, macabre adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471670/extras/3e3296b8376046ee8519584730d82e39.webp?t=1749337493\" width=235 height=30 /></span>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark horror game with mature, disturbing themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Multiple endings depending on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > An atmospheric and moody original soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evocative and chilling pixel-art graphics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional point and click gameplay with modern mechanics and user interface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychosexual demons that will give any budding psychologist food for thought.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Stolen Apple","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471670/50bc2a91d3a415c6fbbdea5a5ddc73bd7f7fb113.jpg"},{"name":"That Devilish Drink","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471670/2ca2a162e655d5e7df77f6c40c08c456f4566e85.jpg"},{"name":"Those Blue Eyes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471670/b5230cbbcb1c6a71680bc02cfc75edd95deaeee4.jpg"},{"name":"Your Suffering Will Have No End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471670/c7b4f2dcd80d121edd229387e7847191785ee5a4.jpg"},{"name":"To Dust You Return","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471670/7f36c3e8a2da4aa162e54deb817ec328fa507d9d.jpg"},{"name":"I Want Life","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471670/97df4b15c270482559c5a036959487420c0e6b4f.jpg"},{"name":"How'd You Like Them Apples?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471670/f564d8b299104f8dc5c1f6dd2fb137e50713c4fe.jpg"},{"name":"A Guiding Light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471670/1fc6912b9b43f5d0cf132af48c90da661a27f74f.jpg"},{"name":"I'll Figure It Out On My Own","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3471670/62eb1657ffd1d048776